{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b804bf8d-9501-8a2d-8fda-836ffe038cab",
  "created_at": "2026-03-05T11:07:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Raj Rahman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:03:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:03:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. My name is Raj Rahman. I want to report a bad place in the road, a dip, in front of my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:03:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Rahman. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:03:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 195 Marsh Street, in the Point. The dip is right in front, by the curb, maybe a little into the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:03:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And is it a pothole, or more of a sunken area?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:03:36-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "More sunken. Last fall they dug a trench there for the utility, you know, for the pipe or the wire, I am not sure which. They filled it and put the black on top. Now it has settled. It went down, like a bowl. About, I would say, three or four inches at the lowest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:04:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the patch over the utility trench has settled and left a dip. Is it long, like a strip, or round?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:04:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A strip. Maybe the length of a car, a little more. Every car going by bumps, and it is wicked, as you say here. My neighbor's car bottomed out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:04:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, those are hard on the undercarriage. I'll put all that in the request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:04:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Now I have a question. If a car is damaged by this, does the city pay for it? Reimburse, is that the word?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:04:45-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Reimburse, yes. Honestly, I can't tell you how that goes. Damage claims are handled separately, and I don't decide them. If your neighbor wants to pursue it, the city clerk's office can tell them how to file a claim. I can transfer you there if you'd like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:05:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it is not my car. I will tell him to call. Is the clerk's office in City Hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:05:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is. He can call the main City Hall line and ask for the city clerk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:05:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. And how long do the repairs usually take? From the report to when they fix it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:05:34-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It varies. This time of year, with the freeze and thaw, the crews have a long list. Could be a couple of weeks, could be longer. Settled utility patches sometimes involve the utility company too, so someone has to figure out who's responsible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:05:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Figure out who is responsible. So it can go back and forth between them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:06:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can, a little. But the request starts with us, and somebody will go out and look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:06:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, good. Will somebody call me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:06:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can have them call if they need more details. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:06:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0161. It is my home phone, I am here most days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:06:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0161. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:06:30-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Excuse me, one more thing, I am sorry. I am craving a doughnut now, talking about this. The jelly kind, with the sugar on the outside. Do you know a good place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:06:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not going to pick a favorite for you, but there are a couple of shops in town that do a nice jelly doughnut. Try one on your way out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:07:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will. So, just to be sure, you have 195 Marsh Street, the settled trench, a strip like the length of a car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:07:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Sunken utility patch, 195 Marsh, about three or four inches down. It's in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:07:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you very much, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:07:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Rahman. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:07:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
